.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH lrat-doctor 1  lrat 
.SH NAME
lrat\-doctor \- Check the API key, Linear, the terminal, the config and the version
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlrat doctor\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the API key, Linear, the terminal, the config and the version
.PP
Prints one line per check, marked ● (ok), ▲ (warning) or ✘ (failure), each warning or failure followed by how to fix it. Never prints the API key. Exits non\-zero when any check fails.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
